1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
What is Zamorex?
Zamorex is a farmer-to-buyer marketplace platform that connects local farmers directly with buyers. It eliminates middlemen, allowing farmers to get better prices for their produce and buyers to access fresh, locally-grown products at fair prices.

Problem Statement
In many communities, farmers struggle to find buyers for their produce, while buyers struggle to find fresh, affordable local products. Middlemen often take a large cut, reducing farmers' profits and increasing prices for buyers.

Solution
Zamorex provides a digital platform where:

Farmers can list their products with pricing and quantity

Admin approves products to ensure quality and legitimacy

Buyers can browse approved products and contact farmers directly

Key Features
Feature	Description
User Authentication	Secure registration and login with JWT tokens
Role-Based Access	Separate dashboards for Admin, Farmer, and Buyer
Product Management	Farmers can add, view, and delete their products
Admin Approval Workflow	Products are pending until admin approves or rejects
Buyer Marketplace	Buyers view only approved products
Direct Contact	Buyers can contact farmers via phone
Target Users
Admin - Platform manager who approves products and manages users

Farmers - Product sellers who list their farm produce

Buyers - Customers looking to purchase fresh farm products

