📄 5. USER GUIDE
5.1 How to Register
Open the application in your browser

Click the Register link on the login page

Fill in the registration form:

Full Name - Your full name

Phone Number - Your phone number (used for login)

Role - Select either "Farmer" or "Buyer"

Password - Create a password (minimum 6 characters)

Click Create Account

You will be redirected to the login page

Login with your phone number and password

5.2 How to Login
Open the application in your browser

Enter your Phone Number and Password

Click Login

You will be redirected to your role-specific dashboard

5.3 Farmer Guide
Viewing Products
After logging in, you'll see your Farmer Dashboard

All your products are displayed in a table with:

Product name

Category

Price

Quantity

Status (Pending / Approved / Rejected)

Adding a Product
Click the + Add Product button on your dashboard

Fill in the product details:

Product Name - e.g., Fresh Tomatoes

Category - Select from the dropdown

Price - Price per unit

Quantity - Available quantity

Click Add Product

Your product will appear with "Pending" status

Wait for admin approval

Deleting a Product
Find the product in your table

Click the Delete button next to the product

Confirm deletion when prompted

The product will be removed

Understanding Status
🟡 Pending - Awaiting admin approval

🟢 Approved - Visible to buyers

🔴 Rejected - Not visible, needs modification

5.4 Admin Guide
Approving Products
Log in as Admin

You'll see the Admin Dashboard

Click the Pending Approvals tab

Review each pending product:

Check product name, price, quantity

Verify the farmer ID

Click Approve to approve the product

Click Reject to reject the product

Managing Users
Click the Manage Users tab

View all registered users in the table

Search for users by name or phone

Delete users by clicking the Delete button (admins cannot be deleted)

5.5 Buyer Guide
Browsing Products
Log in as Buyer

You'll see all approved products

Products are displayed in a grid with:

Product name and category

Price

Stock quantity

Farmer name

Contacting a Farmer
Find a product you're interested in

Click the 📞 Contact Farmer button

This will initiate a phone call to the farmer (on mobile devices)

Discuss pricing, delivery, and purchase directly with the farmer

